complete:line032","quote":"承字仲嗣，少以才學知名，與諸葛瑾、歩騭、嚴畯相友善。權爲驃騎將軍，辟西曹掾，出爲長沙西部都尉。討平山寇，得精兵萬五千人。後爲濡須都督、奮威將軍，封都鄕侯，領部曲五千人。承爲人壯毅忠讜，能甄識人物，拔彭城蔡款、南陽謝景於孤微童幼，後並爲國士，款至衞尉，景豫章太守。又諸葛恪年少時，眾人奇其英才。承言終敗諸葛氏者，元遜也。勤於長進，篤於物類，凡在庶幾之流，無不造門，年六十七，赤烏七年卒，謚曰定侯。子震嗣。初，承喪妻，昭欲爲索諸葛瑾女，承以相與有好，難之，權聞而勸焉，遂爲婿。生女，權爲子和納之。權數令和修敬於承，執子婿之禮。震諸葛恪誅時亦死。","source_term":"權爲子和納之"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu052-zc-he","interpretation_note":"本來源明記世代。後綴只供識別。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"572_278_cba"}},{"id":"roi_rz4_ute_B","label":"張承","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","review":"ai_provisional","aliases":[{"surface":"承","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line024:m0068","c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0000","c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0084","c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0146","c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0203","c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0216","c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0253","c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032-pei02-01:m0005","c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032-pei02-01:m0018"]},{"surface":"仲嗣","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0002"]},{"surface":"張奮威","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116:m0149"]},{"surface":"張承","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-052-compiler-appraisal:line124:m0105","c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line087:m0149"]},{"surface":"张承","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line087-pei01-01:m0010"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line024","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line024:m0068","quote":"承"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032","me