爵。","source_term":"長子承"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu052-zz-cheng","interpretation_note":"本來源明記世代。後綴只供識別。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"roi_rz4_ute"}},{"id":"roi_rz4_ute_BB","label":"張氏〔張承女、孫和嫡妃〕","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","review":"ai_provisional","aliases":[],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0237","quote":"女"}],"identity_note":"卷52張承女為孫和所納，卷59稱張休為和妃叔父，卷50稱嫡妃張氏。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032","quote":"承字仲嗣，少以才學知名，與諸葛瑾、歩騭、嚴畯相友善。權爲驃騎將軍，辟西曹掾，出爲長沙西部都尉。討平山寇，得精兵萬五千人。後爲濡須都督、奮威將軍，封都鄕侯，領部曲五千人。承爲人壯毅忠讜，能甄識人物，拔彭城蔡款、南陽謝景於孤微童幼，後並爲國士，款至衞尉，景豫章太守。又諸葛恪年少時，眾人奇其英才。承言終敗諸葛氏者，元遜也。勤於長進，篤於物類，凡在庶幾之流，無不造門，年六十七，赤烏七年卒，謚曰定侯。子震嗣。初，承喪妻，昭欲爲索諸葛瑾女，承以相與有好，難之，權聞而勸焉，遂爲婿。生女，權爲子和納之。權數令和修敬於承，執子婿之禮。震諸葛恪誅時亦死。","source_term":"生女"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu052-zc-daughter","interpretation_note":"本來源明記世代。後綴只供識別。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"roi_rz4_ute_B"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0237"],"paragraph_ids":["c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0237","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0237"],"kind":"paragraph"}]